      <path class="t" pathLength="1" d="M560 640 C520 590 506 560 506 530 A54 54 0 1 1 614 530 C614 560 600 590 560 640 Z M560 530 m-18 0 a18 18 0 1 0 36 0 a18 18 0 1 0 -36 0" />
